OL,3,GNEWSAFormer leader convicted of fraud
OL,4,Aquits as councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council confirmed on Thursday that
OL,7,FZadrozny had resigned as councillor for
OL,8,FLarwood, adding there would be no
OL,9,Fby-election until the local elections
OL,10,Fin May.
